a, please come here." Although calling the name of his son, he nevertheless uttered the four syllables n\'e4-r\'e4-ya-\'eba. Simply by chanting the name of N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a in this way, he sufficiently atoned for the sinful reactions of millions of lives.
