We must know the present need of human society. And what is that need? Human society is 
no longer bounded by geographical limits to particular countries or communities. Human society is broader than in the Middle Ages, and the world tendency is toward one state or one human society. The ideals of spiritual communism, according to }{
\i\insrsid1120308\charrsid7749098 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3018\insrsid1120308\charrsid4206485 
, are based more or less on the oneness of the entire human society, nay, of the entire energy of living beings. The need is felt by great thinkers to make this a successful ideology. }{\i\insrsid1120308\charrsid7749098 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{
\cs3018\insrsid1120308\charrsid4206485  will fill this need in human society. It begins, therefore, with the aphorism of Ved\'e4nta philosophy (}{\i\insrsid1120308\charrsid7749098 janm\'e4dy asya yata\'f9}{\insrsid1120308 )}{
\insrsid1120308\charrsid13640859  to establish the ideal of a common cause.
\par }{\insrsid1120308\charrsid7749098 Human society, at the present moment, is not in the darkness of oblivion. It has made rapid progress in the field of material comforts, educat
ion and economic development throughout the entire world. But there is a pinprick somewhere in the social body at large, and therefore there are large-scale quarrels, even over less important issues. There is need of a clue as to how humanity can become o
ne in peace, friendship and prosperity with a common cause. }{\i\insrsid1120308\charrsid7749098 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\insrsid1120308\charrsid4206485 
 will fill this need, for it is a cultural presentation for the re-spiritualization of the entire human society.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1120308 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1120308\charrsid7749098 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{
\cs3018\fs28\cf1\insrsid1120308\charrsid4206485  should be introduced also in the schools and colleges, for it is recommended by the great student devotee Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja in order to change the demoniac face of society.
