\'e4r\'e4ja Par\'e9k\'f1it and \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 on the bank of the Ganges, and another at Naimi\'f1\'e4ra\'ebya between S\'fcta Gosv\'e4m\'e9 and the sages at Naimi\'f1\'e4ra\'ebya Forest, headed by \'c7aunaka \'c5\'f1
