ouls as the saint Maitreya and his disciple Vidura. With this understanding of the history of the}{\insrsid3943952  }{\i\insrsid1120308\charrsid345548 Bh\'e4gavatam}{\insrsid3943952 , }{\insrsid1120308\charrsid4206485 
