para-du\'f9kha-du\'f9kh\'e9;}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  in other words, he has no personal troubles, but he is very unhappy to see others in trouble. Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja said, "My Lord, I have no personal problems, for I have learned how to glorify Your transcendental qualities and thus enter a trance of ecstasy. I do have a problem, however, for I am simply thinking of these rascals and fools who are busy with }{
