{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  "I shall free you from all sinful reactions and give you liberation." Therefore in response to the inquiries of Par\'e9k\'f1it Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9, his }{
