\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 ). \'c7r\'e9la R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 has also advised that }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 aty\'e4h\'e4ra,}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 too much eating, is an impediment to advancement in spiritual life. Also, in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (6.17) K\'e5\'f1\'eba says:
