\par yath\'e4 k\'e5\'f1\'eb\'e4rpita-pr\'e4\'ebas
\par tat-puru\'f1a-ni\'f1evay\'e4
\par }\pard\plain \s1146\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v\fs28\insrsid3943952 SYNONYMS}{\v\fs28\insrsid10252087 
\par }\pard\plain \s3019\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb240\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1521817 \f35\fs28\cf9\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 na}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash not; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 
tath\'e4}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash so much; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 hi}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash certainly; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 agha-v\'e4n}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash a man full of sinful activities; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 r\'e4jan}{
\insrsid10252087 \emdash O King; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 p\'fcyeta}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash can become purified; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 tapa\'f9-\'e4dibhi\'f9}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash by executing the principles of austerity, penance, }{
\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 brahmacarya}{\insrsid10252087  and other purifying processes; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 yath\'e4}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash as much as; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 k\'e5\'f1\'eba-arpita-pr\'e4\'eba\'f9}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash 
the devotee whose life is fully K\'e5\'f1\'eba conscious; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 tat-puru\'f1a-ni\'f1evay\'e4}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash by engaging his life in the service of K\'e5\'f1\'eba's representative.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s3000\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid741136 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 
My dear King, if a sinful person engages in the service of a bona fide devotee of the Lord and thus learns how to dedicate his life unto the lotus feet of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, he can be completely purified. One cannot be purified merely by undergoing austerity, penance, brahmacarya and the other methods of atonement I have previously described.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Tat-puru\'f1a}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 refers to a preacher of K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness, such as the spiritual master. \'c7r\'e9la Narottama d\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4kura has said, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ch\'e4\'f2iy\'e4 vai\'f1\'ebava-sev\'e4 nist\'e4ra p\'e4yeche keb\'e4:}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  "Without serving a bona fide spiritual master, an ideal Vai\'f1\'ebava, who can be delivered from the clutches of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 m\'e4y\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 ?" This idea is also expressed in many other places. }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  (5.5.2) says, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mahat-sev\'e4\'e0 dv\'e4ram \'e4hur vimukte\'f9:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  if one desires liberation from the clutches of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 m\'e4y\'e4,}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  one must associate with a pure devotee }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah\'e4tm\'e4.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  A }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah\'e4tm\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  is one who engages twenty-four hours daily in the loving service of the Lord. As K\'e5\'f1\'eba says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  (9.13):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah\'e4tm\'e4nas tu m\'e4\'e0 p\'e4rtha\line daiv\'e9\'e0 prak\'e5tim \'e4\'e7rit\'e4
\'f9\line bhajanty ananya-manaso\line j\'ef\'e4tv\'e4 bh\'fct\'e4dim avyayam
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 "O son of P\'e5th\'e4, those who are not de
luded, the great souls, are under the protection of the divine nature. They are fully engaged in devotional service because they know Me as the Supreme Personality of Godhead, original and inexhaustible." Thus the symptom of a }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah\'e4tm\'e4}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  is that he has no engagement other than service to K\'e5\'f1\'eba. One must render service to a Vai\'f1\'eb
ava in order to get freed from sinful reactions, revive one's original K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness and be trained in how to love K\'e5\'f1\'eba. This is the result of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah\'e4tma-sev\'e4.}{
\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  Of course, if one eng
ages in the service of a pure devotee, the reactions of one's sinful life are vanquished automatically. Devotional service is necessary not to drive away an insignificant stock of sins, but to awaken our dormant love for K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. As fog is vanquished at the }{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 first glimpse of sunlight, one's sinful reactions are automatically vanquished as soon as one begins serving a pure devotee; no separate endeavor is required.}{
\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid13966757 k\'e5\'f1\'eba}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 rpita-pr\'e4\'eba\'f9}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  refers to a devotee who dedicates his life to serving K\'e5\'f1\'eba, not to being saved from the path to hellish life. A devotee is }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba-par\'e4ya\'eba,}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 v\'e4sudeva-par\'e4ya\'eba,}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 which means that the path of V\'e4sudeva, or the devotional path, is his life and soul. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba-par\'e4\'f9 sarve na kuta\'e7cana bibhyati}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (}{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1651685\charrsid1651685 Bh\'e4g.}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  6.17.28): such a devotee i
s not afraid of going anywhere. There is a path toward liberation in the higher planetary systems and a path toward the hellish planets, but a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba-para}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 devotee is unafraid wherever he is sent; he simply wants to remember K\'e5\'f1\'eba, wherever he may be. Such a devotee is unconcerned with hell and heaven; he is simply attached to rendering service to K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. When a devotee is put into hellish conditions, he accepts them as K\'e5\'f1\'eba's mercy: }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 tat te 'nukamp\'e4\'e0 susam\'e9k\'f1am\'e4\'eba\'f9}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (}{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1651685\charrsid1651685 Bh\'e4g.}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  10.14.8). He does not protest, "Oh, I am such a great devotee of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. Why have I been put into this misery?" Instead he thinks, "This is K\'e5\'f1\'eba's mercy." Such an attitude is possible for a devotee who engages in the service of K\'e5\'f1\'eba's representative. This is the secret of success.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.1.17
