\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bhakti}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  is one who cannot perform the ritualistic ceremonies recommended in the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 karma-k\'e4\'eb\'f2a}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  section of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vedas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  or is not sufficiently educated to speculate on spiritual subjects. M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9s gener
ally allege that the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bhakti}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  path is for women and illiterates. This is a groundless accusation. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bhakti}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  path is followed by the most learned scholars, such as the Gosv\'e4m\'e9s, Lord Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu and R\'e4m\'e4nuj\'e4c\'e4rya. These are the actual followers of the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bhakti}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  path. Regardless of whether or not one is educated or aristocratic, one must follow in their footsteps. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Mah\'e4jano yena gata
\'f9 sa panth\'e4\'f9:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  one must follow the path of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah\'e4janas.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah
\'e4janas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  are those who have taken to the path of devotional service (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 su\'e7\'e9l\'e4\'f9 s\'e4dhavo yatra n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba-par\'e4ya\'eb\'e4\'f9}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 ), for these great personalities are the perfect persons. As stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  (5.18.12):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 yasy\'e4sti bhaktir bhagavaty aki\'efcan\'e4\line sarvair gu\'ebais tatra sam\'e4
sate sur\'e4\'f9
