he Personality of Godhead has all the good qualities of the demigods." The less intelligent, however, misunderstand the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bhakti}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
 path and therefore allege that it is for one who cannot execute ritualistic ceremonies or speculate. As confirmed here by the word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sadhr\'e9c\'e9na\'f9, bhakti}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
 is the path that is appropriate, not the paths of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 karma-k\'e4\'eb\'f2a}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 j\'ef\'e4na-k\'e4\'eb\'f2a.}{
\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9s may be }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 su\'e7\'e9l\'e4\'f9 s\'e4dhava\'f9}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
 (well-behaved saintly persons), but there is nevertheless some doubt about whether they are actually making progress, for they have not accepted the path of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bhakti.}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
 On the other hand, those who follow the path of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e4c\'e4ryas}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  are }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 su\'e7\'e9l\'e4\'f9}{
\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 s\'e4dhava\'f9,}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  but furthermore their path is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 akuto-bhaya,}{
\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  which means free from fear. One should fearlessly follow the twelve }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah\'e4janas}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  and t
heir line of disciplic succession and thus be liberated from the clutches of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 m\'e4y\'e4.
