\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid7496151 O}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 ne who performs auspicious activity is never overcome by evil." The highest }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 kaly\'e4\'eba}{
\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (auspicious) activity is to surrender to K\'e5\'f1\'eba. That is the only path by which to save oneself from falling down into hellish life. \'c7r\'e9la Prabodh\'e4nanda Sarasvat\'e9 has confirm
ed this as follows:
