a because of his excessive attachment to his son. Nevertheless, because of his past good fortune in having rendered devotional service to N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, he apparently chanted the holy name in full devotional service and without offenses."
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.1.31
