\'ebu; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 v\'e4ray\'e4m \'e4su\'f9}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash forbade; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 ojas\'e4}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash with resounding voices.
