ja, the son of the sun-god, were thus forbidden, they replied:}{\cs3002\fs28\insrsid10252087\charrsid741136  Who are you, sirs, that have the audacity to challenge the jurisdiction of Yamar\'e4ja?
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
