mila, he was within the jurisdiction of Yamar\'e4ja, the supreme judge appointed to consider the sins of the living entities. When forbidden to touch Aj\'e4mila, the order carriers of Yamar\'e4
ja were surprised because they had never been hindered in the execution of their duty by anyone within the three worlds.
