\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vedas.}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vedas}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  contain nothing besides the instructions of Vi\'f1\'eb
