y living being. He is as good as Lord Brahm\'e4
. He has the complete cooperation of the Supreme Lord, who is situated in everyone's heart, and therefore, by the grace of the Supersoul, he can see the past, present and future of a living being from within. The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
anum\'e9m\'e4\'e0sate}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  means that he can decide in consultation with the Supersoul. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Anu}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 means "following." The actual decisions concerning the next lives of the living entities are made by the Supersoul, and they are carried out by Yamar\'e4ja.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.1.49
