As a sleeping person acts according to the body manifested in his dreams and accepts it to be himself, so one identifies with his present body, which he acquired because of his past religious or irreligious actions, and is unable to know his past or 
future lives.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
A man engages in sinful activities because he does not know what he did in his past life to get his present materially conditioned body, which is subjected to the threefold miseries. As stated by \'c5\'f1abhadeva in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
\'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  (5.5.4), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 n\'fcna\'e0 pramatta\'f9 kurute vikarma:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 a human being who is mad after sense gratification does not hesitate to act sinfully. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Yad indriya-pr\'e9taya \'e4p\'e5\'eboti:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 he performs sinful actions simply for sense gratification. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Na s\'e4dhu manye:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  this is not good. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Yata \'e4tmano 'yam asann api kle
\'e7ada \'e4sa deha\'f9:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  because of such sinful actions, one receives another body in which to suffer as he is suffering in his present body because of his past sinful activities.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 It should be understood that a person who does not have Vedic knowle
dge always acts in ignorance of what he has done in the past, what he is doing at the present and how he will suffer in the future. He is completely in darkness. Therefore the Vedic injunction is, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 tamasi m\'e4:}{
\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  "Don't remain in darkness." }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Jyotir gama:}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  "Try to
 go to the light." The light or illumination is Vedic knowledge, which one can understand when he is elevated to the mode of goodness or when he transcends the mode of goodness by engaging in devotional service to the spiritual master and the Supreme Lord
. This is described in the }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c7vet\'e4\'e7vatara Upani\'f1ad}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (6.23):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 yasya deve par\'e4 bhaktir\line yath\'e4 deve tath\'e4 gurau\line tasyaite kathit\'e4
 hy arth\'e4\'f9\line prak\'e4\'e7ante mah\'e4tmana\'f9}{\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
"Unto those great souls who have implicit faith in both the Lord and the spiritual master, all the imports of Vedic knowledge are automatically revealed." The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vedas}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
 enjoin, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 tad-vij\'ef\'e4n\'e4rtha\'e0 sa gurum ev\'e4bhigacchet:}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  one must approach a spiritual master who has full knowledge of the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vedas}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  and be faithfully directed by him in order to become a devotee of the Lord. Then the knowledge of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vedas}{
\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  will be revealed. When the Vedic knowledge is revealed, one need no longer remain in the darkness of material nature.
\par }\pard\plain \s3005\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3824524 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
According to his association with the material modes of nature\emdash goodness, passion and ignorance\emdash a living entity gets a particular type of body. The example of one who associates with the mode of goodness is a qualified }{
\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'eba.}{\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  Such a }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'eba}{\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 knows past, present and future because he consults the Vedic literature and sees through the eyes of }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 \'e7\'e4stra}{\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (}{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 \'e7\'e4stra-cak\'f1u\'f9}{
\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 ). He can understand what his past life was, why he is in the present body, and how he can obtain liberation from the clutches of }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 m\'e4y\'e4}{\insrsid10252087 
 and not accept another material body. This is all possible when one is situated in the mode of goodness. Generally, however, the living entities are engrossed in the modes of passion and ignorance.
\par In any case, one receives an inferior or superior body at the discretion of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, Param\'e4tm\'e4. As stated in the previous verse:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 manasaiva pure deva\'f9\line p\'fcrva-r\'fcpa\'e0 vipa\'e7yati\line anum\'e9m\'e4\'e0
sate 'p\'fcrva\'e0\line manas\'e4 bhagav\'e4n aja\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 Everything depends on }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bhagav\'e4
n,}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 aja\'f9,}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  the unborn. Why doesn't one please Bhagav\'e4n to receive a better body? The answer is }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 aj\'efas tamas\'e4:}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  because of gross ignorance. One who is in comple
te darkness cannot know what his past life was or what his next life will be; he is simply interested in his present body. Even though he has a human body, a person in the mode of ignorance and interested only in his present body is like an animal, for an
 }{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
animal, being covered by ignorance, thinks that the ultimate goal of life and happiness is to eat as much as possible. A human being must be educated to understand his past life and how he can endeavor for a better life in the future. There is even a b}{
\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 ook, called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bh\'e5gu-sa\'e0hit\'e4,}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
 which reveals information about one's past, present and future lives according to astrological calculations. Somehow or other one must be enlightened about his past, present and future. One who is interested only in his present body 
and who tries to enjoy his senses to the fullest extent is understood to be engrossed in the mode of ignorance. His future is very, very dark. Indeed, the future is always dark for one who is grossly covered by ignorance. Especially in this age, human soc
i}{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 ety is covered by the mode of ignorance, and therefore everyone thinks his present body to be everything, without consideration of the past or future.}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 

\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.1.50
\par }\pard\plain \s2995\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10252087 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 TEXT 50
