and fix me as one of the particles of dust at Your lotus feet, that will save me."
\par }\pard\plain \s3005\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3824524 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 In a similar way, Bhaktivinoda \'d6h\'e4kura sang:
