e gross body. Thus the gross body acts during one's lifetime, and the subtle body acts at the time of death. The subtle body, which is called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 li\'ecga,}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
