\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  if at the time of sex the secretions of the mother are more profuse than those of the father, the child will receive a female body, and if the secretions of the father are
 more profuse than those of the mother, the child will receive a male body. These are the subtle laws of nature, which act according to the desire of the living entity. If a human being is taught to change his subtle body by developing a consciousness of 
K\'e5\'f1\'eba, at the time of death the subtle body will create a gross body in which he will be a devotee of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, or if he is still more perfect, he will not take another material body but will immediately get a spiritual body and thus return home, back to Godhe}{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
ad. This is the process of the transmigration of the soul. Therefore instead of trying to unite human society through pacts for sense gratification that can never be achieved, it is clearly desirable to teach people how to become K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a conscious and return home, back to Godhead. This is true now and, indeed, at any time.}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
