 there was a ruler even above Yamar\'e4ja. To eradicate their doubts, Yamar\'e4ja immediately replied, "Yes, there is one supreme controller above everything." Yamar\'e4
ja is in charge of some of the moving living entities, namely the human beings, but the animals,
 who also move, are not under his control. Only human beings have consciousness of right and wrong, and among them only those who perform sinful activities come under the control of Yamar\'e4ja. Therefore although Yamar\'e4
ja is a controller, he is only a departmental controller of a few living entities. There are other demigods who control many other departments, but above them all is one supreme controller, K\'e5\'f1\'eba. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c9\'e7vara
\'f9 parama\'f9 k\'e5\'f1\'eba\'f9 sac-cid-\'e4nanda-vigraha\'f9:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  the supreme controller is K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Others, who contr
ol their own departments in the affairs of the universe, are insignificant in comparison to K\'e5\'f1\'eba, the supreme controller. K\'e5\'f1\'eba says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  (7.7), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 matta\'f9 paratara\'e0 n\'e4nyat ki\'efcid asti dhana\'efjaya:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  "My dear Dhana\'ef
jaya [Arjuna], no one is superior to Me." Therefore Yamar\'e4ja immediately cleared away the doubts of his assistants, the Yamad\'fctas, by confirming that there is a supreme controller above all others.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 \'c7r\'e9la Madhv\'e4c\'e4rya explains that the words }{
