ja therefore stated that the Vi\'f1\'ebud\'fctas resemble the Supreme Personality of Godhead in their bodily features, transcendental qualities and nature. In other words, the Vi\'f1\'ebud\'fctas, or Vai\'f1\'eb
avas, are almost as qualified as the Supreme Lord. Yamar\'e4ja informed the Yamad\'fctas that the Vi\'f1\'ebud\'fctas are no less powerful than Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. Since Vi\'f1\'ebu is above Yamar\'e4ja, the Vi\'f1\'ebud\'fctas are above the Yamad\'fc
tas. Persons protected by the Vi\'f1\'ebud\'fctas, therefore, cannot be touched by the Yamad\'fctas.
