ras, Lord Kapila [the son of Devah\'fcti], Sv\'e4yambhuva Manu, Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, Janaka Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, Grandfather Bh\'e9\'f1ma, Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9
 and I myself know the real religious principle. My dear servants, this transcendental religious principle, which is known as bh\'e4gavata-dharma, or surrender u
nto the Supreme Lord and love for Him, is uncontaminated by the material modes of nature. It is very confidential and difficult for ordinary human beings to understand, but if by chance one fortunately understands it, he is immediately liberated, and thus
 he returns home, back to Godhead.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
