me free from all sinful reactions simply by remembering the lotus feet of the Lord day and night [}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ahar-ni\'e7am}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 ]." Furthermore, he quotes from }{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (6.3.31):
