\par }\pard\plain \s3000\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid741136 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 Because they are bewildered by the illusory energy of the Supr
eme Personality of Godhead, Y\'e4j\'efavalkya and Jaimini and other compilers of the religious scriptures cannot know the secret, confidential religious system of the twelve mah\'e4
janas. They cannot understand the transcendental value of performing devotional service or chanting the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba mantra. Because their minds are attracted to the ritualistic ceremonies mentioned in the Vedas\emdash especially the Yajur Veda, S
\'e4ma Veda and \'c5g Veda\emdash their intelligence has become dull. Thus they are busy collecting the ingredients
 for ritualistic ceremonies that yield only temporary benefits, such as elevation to Svargaloka for material happiness. They are not attracted to the sa\'eck\'e9rtana movement; instead, they are interested in dharma, artha, k\'e4ma and mok\'f1a.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 Since one may 
easily achieve the highest success by chanting the holy name of the Lord, one may ask why there are so many Vedic ritualistic ceremonies and why people are attracted to them. This verse answers that question. As stated in }{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  (15.15), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 vedai\'e7 ca sarvair aham eva vedya\'f9:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 the real purpose of studying the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vedas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  is to approach the lotus feet of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Unfortunately, unintelligent people bewildered by the grandeur of Vedic }
{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 yaj\'efas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  want to see gorgeous sacrifices performed. They want Vedic }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mantras}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  ch
anted and huge amounts of money spent for such ceremonies. Sometimes we have to observe the Vedic ritualistic ceremonies to please such unintelligent men. Recently, when we established a large K\'e5\'f1\'eba-Balar\'e4ma temple in V\'e5nd\'e4
vana, we were obliged to have Vedic ceremonies enacted by }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  because the inhabitants of V\'e5nd\'e4vana, especially the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sm\'e4rta-br\'e4hma\'ebas,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  would not accept Europeans and Americans as bona fide }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas.}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  Thus we had to engage }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  to perform costly }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 yaj\'efas.}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  In spite of these }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 yaj\'efas,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  the members of our Society performed }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa\'eck\'e9
rtana}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  loudly with }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 m\'e5da\'ecgas,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  and I considered the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  more important than the Vedic ritualistic ceremonies. Both the ceremonies and the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 were going on simultaneously. The ceremonies were meant for persons interested in Vedic rituals for elevation to heavenly planets (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ja\'f2\'e9-k\'e5ta-matir madhu-pu\'f1pit\'e4y\'e4m}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 ), whereas the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 was meant for pure devotees interested in pleasing the Supreme Personality of Godhead. We would simply have performed }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa\'eck\'e9rtana,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  but then the inhabitants of V
\'e5nd\'e4vana would not have taken the installation ceremony seriously. As explained here, the Vedic performances are meant for those whose intelligence has been dulled by the flowery language of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vedas,}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  which describe fruitive activities intended to elevate one to the higher planets.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 Especially in this age of Kali, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  alone is sufficient. If the members of our temples in the different parts of the world simply continue }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa\'eck\'e9
rtana}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  before the Deity, especially before \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4
prabhu, they will remain perfect. There is no need of any other performances. Nevertheless, to keep oneself clean in habits and mind, Deity worship and other regulative principles are required. \'c7r\'e9la J\'e9va Gosv\'e4m\'e9 says that although }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  is sufficient for the perfection of life, the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 arcan\'e4,}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 or worship of the Deity in the temple, must continue in order that the devotees may stay clean and pure. \'c7r\'e9la Bhaktisiddh\'e4nta Sarasvat\'e9 \'d6h\'e4kura therefore recommended that one follow both processes simul
taneously. We strictly follow his principle of performing Deity worship and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  along parallel lines. This we should continue.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.3.26
