kura quotes the following verse from the prayers of Lord Brahm\'e4 (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1651685\charrsid1651685 Bh\'e4g.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  10.14.29):
