By nature's law, or the arrangement of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, one kind of living entity is eatable by other living entities. As mentioned herein, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 dvi-pad\'e4\'e0 ca catu\'f1-pada\'f9:}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  the four-legged animals (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 catu\'f1-pada\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 ), as well as food grains, are eatables for human beings (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 dvi-pad\'e4m}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 ). These four-legged animals are those such as deer and goats, not cows, which are meant to be protected. Generally the men of the higher classes of society
\emdash the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas, k\'f1atriyas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 vai\'e7yas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 \emdash 
do not eat meat. Sometimes }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 k\'f1atriyas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 go to the forest to kill animals like deer because they have to learn the art of killing, and sometimes they eat the animals also. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c7\'fcdras,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 too, eat animals such as goats. Cows, however, are never meant to be killed or eaten by human beings. In every }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e7\'e4stra,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 cow killing is vehemently condemned. Indeed, one who kills a cow must suffer for as many years as there are hairs on the body of a cow. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Manu-sa\'e0hit\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  says, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 prav\'e5ttir e\'f1\'e4 bh\'fct\'e4n\'e4\'e0 niv\'e5ttis tu mah\'e4-phal\'e4:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 we have many tendencies in this material world, but in human life one is meant to learn how to curb those tendencies. Those who desire to eat meat may satisfy the demands of their tongues by eating lower animals, but they should never 
kill cows, who are actually accepted as the mothers of human society because they supply milk. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e7\'e4stra}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  especially recommends, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 k\'e5\'f1i-go-rak\'f1ya:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 vai\'e7ya}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 section of humanity should arrange for the food of the entire society through agricultural activities and should give full protection to the cows, which are the most useful animals because they supply milk to human society.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.4.10
