n
g is to see that all parents do their duty properly. Similarly, the king is also responsible for overseeing the other protectors mentioned in this verse. It may also be noted that the beggars who should be maintained by the householders are not profession
al beggars, but }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sanny\'e4s\'e9s}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
