\insrsid10252087 \emdash and of remembrance; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 sampramo\'f1\'e4t}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash due to the destruction; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 ya\'f9}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash who (the Supreme Personality of Godhead); }{
