\par }\pard\plain \s3000\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid741136 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 
When one's consciousness is completely purified of the contamination of material existence, gross and subtle, without being agitated as in the working and dreaming states, and when the mind is not dissolved as in su\'f1
upti, deep sleep, one comes to the platf
orm of trance. Then one's material vision and the memories of the mind, which manifests names and forms, are vanquished. Only in such a trance is the Supreme Personality of Godhead revealed. Thus let us offer our respectful obeisances unto the Supreme Per
sonality of Godhead, who is seen in that uncontaminated, transcendental state.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 There are two stages of God realization. One is called }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 suj\'efeyam,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  or very easily understood (generally by mental speculation), and the other is called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 durj\'efeyam,}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  understood only with difficulty. Param\'e4tm\'e4 realization and Brahman realization are considered }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 suj\'efeyam,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640 
 but realization of the Supreme Personality of Godhead is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 durj\'efeyam.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  As described here, one attains the ultimate realization of the Personality of Godhead when on
e gives up the activities of the mind\emdash thinking, feeling and willing\emdash or, in other words, when mental speculation stops. This transcendental realization is above }{\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 su\'f1upti}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ,}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  deep sleep. In our gross conditional stage we perceive things through material experien
ce and remembrance, and in the subtle stage we perceive the world in dreams. The process of vision also involves remembrance and also exists in a subtle form. Above gross experience and dreams is }{\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 su\'f1upti}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  deep sleep, and when one comes to the completely spiritual platform, transcending deep sleep, he attains trance, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 vi\'e7
uddha-sattva,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 vasudeva-sattva,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  in which the Personality of Godhead is revealed.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Ata\'f9 \'e7r\'e9-k\'e5\'f1\'eba-n\'e4m\'e4di na bhaved gr\'e4hyam indriyai\'f9:}{
\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  as long as one is situated in duality, on the sensual platform, gross or subtle, realization of the original Personality of Godhead is impossible. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Sevonmukhe hi jihv
\'e4dau svayam eva sphuraty ada\'f9:}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  but when one engages his senses in the service of the Lord\emdash specifically, when one engages the tongue in chanting the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mantra}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  and tasting only K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 pras\'e4da}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  with a spirit of service
\emdash the Supreme Personality of Godhead is revealed. This is indicated in this verse by the word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e7uci-sadmane.}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c7uci}{
\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  means purified. By the spirit of rendering service with one's senses, one's entire existence becomes }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e7uci-sadma,}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 the platform of uncontaminated purity. Dak\'f1a therefore offers his respectful obeisances unto the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is revealed on the platform of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e7uci-sadma.}{
\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  In this regard \'c7r\'e9la Vi\'e7van\'e4tha Cakravart\'e9 \'d6h\'e4kura quotes the following prayer by Lord Brahm\'e4 from the }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{
\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (10.14.6): }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 tath\'e4pi bh\'fcman mahim\'e4gu\'ebasya te viboddhum arhaty amal\'e4ntar-\'e4tmabhi\'f9.}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 "One whose heart has become completely purified, my Lord, can understand the transcendental qualities of Your Lordship and can understand the greatness of Your activities."
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.4.27, SB 6.4.28, SB 6.4.27-28
