 The pure stage of existence is described in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3348640  (7.28), wherein K\'e5\'f1\'eba says:
