\par }\pard\plain \s3023\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9723571 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 
"One can understand the Supreme Personality of Godhead as He is only by devotional service. And when one is in full consciousness of the Supreme Lord by such devotion, he can enter into the kingdom of God."
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 Thus although the subject matter is }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 durvij\'efeyam,}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 extremely difficult to understand, it becomes easy if one follows the prescribed method. Coming in touch with the Supreme Personality of Godhead is possible through pure devotional service, which begins with }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e7rava
\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtana\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebo\'f9.}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  In this regard, \'c7r\'e9la Vi\'e7van\'e4tha Cakravart\'e9 \'d6h\'e4kura quotes a verse from }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{
\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (2.8.5): }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 pravi\'f1\'f6a\'f9 kar\'eba-randhre\'eba sv\'e4n\'e4\'e0 bh\'e4va-saroruham.}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 The process of hearing and chanting enters the core of the heart, and in this way one
 becomes a pure devotee. By continuing this process, one comes to the stage of transcendental love, and then he appreciates the transcendental name, form, qualities and pastimes of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. In other words, a pure devotee, by dev
o
tional service, is able to see the Supreme Personality of Godhead despite many material impediments, which are all various energies of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Easily making his way through these impediments, a devotee comes directly in contact
 with the Supreme Personality of Godhead. After all, the material impediments described in these verses are but various energies of the Lord. When a devotee is eager to see the Supreme Personality of Godhead, he prays to the Lord:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ayi nanda-tanuja ki\'eckara\'e0\line patita\'e0 m\'e4\'e0 vi\'f1ame bhav\'e4mbudhau
\line k\'e5pay\'e4 tava p\'e4da-pa\'eckaja-\line sthita-dh\'fcl\'e9-sad\'e5\'e7a\'e0 vicintaya}{\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 "O son of Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Nanda [K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a], I am Your eternal servitor, yet somehow or other I have fallen into the ocean of birth and death. Please pick me up from this ocean 
of death and place me as one of the atoms at Your lotus feet." Being pleased with the devotee, the Lord turns all his material impediments into spiritual service. In this connection \'c7r\'e9la Vi\'e7van\'e4tha Cakravart\'e9 }{
\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 \'d6h\'e4kura quotes a verse}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  from the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vi\'f1\'ebu Pur\'e4\'eba:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 hl\'e4din\'e9 sandhin\'e9 samvit\line tvayy ek\'e4 sarva-sa\'e0sthitau\line hl\'e4da-t
\'e4pa-kar\'e9 mi\'e7r\'e4\line tvayi no gu\'eba-varjite
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
In the material world, the spiritual energy of the Supreme Personality of Godhead is manifested as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 t\'e4pa-kar\'e9,}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  which means "causing miseries." Everyone hankers fo
r happiness, but although happiness originally comes from the pleasure potency of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, in the material world, because of material activities, the pleasure potency of the Lord becomes a source of miseries (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 hl\'e4da-t\'e4pa-kar\'e9}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 ). Fa
lse happiness in the material world is the source of distress, but when one's endeavors for happiness are redirected toward the satisfaction of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, this }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 t\'e4pa-kar\'e9}{
\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  element of misery is vanquished. An example given in this con
nection is that extracting fire from wood is certainly difficult, but when the fire comes out it burns the wood to ashes. In other words, experiencing the Supreme Personality of Godhead is extremely difficult for those devoid of devotional service, but ev
erything becomes easier for a devotee, and thus he can very easily meet the Supreme Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
Here the prayers say that the form of the Lord is beyond the jurisdiction of material form and is therefore inconceivable. A devotee prays, however, "My dear Lord, be 
pleased with me so that I may very easily see Your transcendental form and potency." Nondevotees try to understand the Supreme Brahman by discussions of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 neti neti.}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Ni\'f1edha-nirv\'e4\'eba-sukh\'e4nubh\'fcti\'f9:}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  a devotee, however, simply by chanting the holy name of the L
ord, avoids such laborious speculations and realizes the existence of the Lord very easily.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.4.29
