 has an intimate relationship with the material world. If the material world were not a part of His body, the Supreme Lord, the supreme cause, would be incomplete. Therefore we hear, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 v\'e4sudeva\'f9 sarvam iti sa mah
\'e4tm\'e4 sudurlabha\'f9:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  }{\cs3012\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid1848463 if one knows that V\'e4sudeva is the original cause of all causes, he becomes a perfect }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah\'e4tm\'e4.

