\par }\pard\plain \s3000\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid741136 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 
Let me offer my respectful obeisances unto the all-pervading Supreme Personality of Godhead, who possesses unlim
ited transcendental qualities. Acting from within the cores of the hearts of all philosophers, who propagate various views, He causes them to forget their own souls while sometimes agreeing and sometimes disagreeing among themselves. Thus He creates withi
n this material world a situation in which they are unable to come to a conclusion. I offer my obeisances unto Him.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087\charrsid8277221 PURPORT}{\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
Since time immemorial or since the creation of the cosmic manifestation, the conditioned souls have formed various parties of philoso
phical speculation, but this is not true of the devotees. Nondevotees have different ideas of creation, maintenance and annihilation, and therefore they are called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 v\'e4d\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  and }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 prativ\'e4d\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \emdash proponents and counterproponents. It is understood from the statement of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Mah\'e4bh\'e4rata}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 that there are many }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 munis,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  or speculators:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 tarko 'prati\'f1\'f6ha\'f9 \'e7rutayo vibhinn\'e4\line n\'e4s\'e4v \'e5\'f1
ir yasya mata\'e0 na bhinnam
\par }\pard\plain \s3023\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9723571 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 
All speculators must disagree with other speculators; otherwise, why should there be so many opposing parties concerned with ascertaining the supreme cause?
\par }\pard\plain \s3005\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3824524 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 Philosophy means finding the ultimate cause. As }{
\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 Ved\'e4nta-s\'fctra}{\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  very reasonably says, }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 ath\'e4to brahma jij\'ef\'e4s\'e4:}{\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 
 human life is meant for understanding the ultimate cause. Devotees accept that the ultimate cause is K\'e5\'f1\'eba because this conclusion is supported by all Vedic literature and also by K\'e5\'f1\'eba Himself, who says, }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 aha
\'e0 sarvasya prabhava\'f9: }{\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 "I am the source of everything." Devotees have no problem understanding the ultimate cause of everything, but nondevotees must face many opposing el
ements because everyone who wants to be a prominent philosopher invents his own way. In India there are many parties of philosophers, such as the }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 dvaita-v\'e4d\'e9s, advaita-v\'e4d\'e9s, vai\'e7e\'f1ikas, m\'e9m\'e4\'e0sakas,}{
\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9s and }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 svabh\'e4va-v\'e4d\'e9s,}{\insrsid10252087  and each of them opposes th
e others. Similarly, in the Western countries there are also many philosophers with different views of creation, life, maintenance and annihilation. Thus it is undoubtedly a fact that there are countless philosophers throughout the world, each of them con
tradicting the others.
\par Now, one might ask why there are so many philosophers if the ultimate goal of philosophy is one. Undoubtedly the ultimate cause is one\emdash the Supreme Brahman. As Arjuna told K\'e5\'f1\'eba in }{\cs2542\i\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  (10.12):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 para\'e0 brahma para\'e0 dh\'e4ma\line pavitra\'e0 parama\'e0 bhav\'e4n\line puru\'f1a
\'e0 \'e7\'e4\'e7vata\'e0 divyam\line \'e4di-devam aja\'e0 vibhum
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
"You are the Supreme Brahman, the ultimate, the supreme abode and purifier, the Absolute Truth and the eternal divine person. You are the primal God, transcendental and original, and You are t
he unborn and all-pervading beauty." Nondevotee speculators, however, do not accept an ultimate cause (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sarva-k\'e4ra\'eba-k\'e4ra\'ebam}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
). Because they are ignorant and bewildered concerning the soul and its activities, even though some of them have a vague idea of the
 soul, many controversies arise, and the philosophical speculators can never reach a conclusion. All of these speculators are envious of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and as K\'e5\'f1\'eba says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t
\'e4}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  (16.19-20):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 t\'e4n aha\'e0 dvi\'f1ata\'f9 kr\'fcr\'e4n\line sa\'e0s\'e4re\'f1u nar\'e4dham\'e4n
\line k\'f1ip\'e4my ajasram a\'e7ubh\'e4n\line \'e4sur\'e9\'f1v eva yoni\'f1u
\par \'e4sur\'e9\'e0 yonim \'e4pann\'e4\line m\'fc\'f2h\'e4 janmani janmani\line m\'e4m apr\'e4pyaiva kaunteya\line tato y\'e4nty adham\'e4\'e0 gatim
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
"Those who are envious and mischievous, who are the lowest among men, are cast by Me into the ocean of material 
existence, into various demoniac species of life. Attaining repeated birth among the species of demoniac life, such persons can never approach Me. Gradually they sink down to the most abominable type of existence." Because of their envy of the Supreme Per
sonality of Godhead, nondevotees are born in demoniac families life after life. They are great offenders, and because of their offenses the Supreme Lord keeps them always bewildered. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Kurvanti cai\'f1\'e4\'e0 muhur \'e4
tma-moham:}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  the Lord, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, purposely keeps them in darkness (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e4tma-moham}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 ).
\par }\pard\plain \s3005\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3824524 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 The great authority Par\'e4\'e7ara, the father of Vy\'e4
sadeva, explains the Supreme Personality of Godhead thus:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 j\'ef\'e4na-\'e7akti-balai\'e7varya-\line v\'e9rya-tej\'e4\'e0sy a\'e7e\'f1ata\'f9
\line bhagavac-chabda-v\'e4cy\'e4ni\line vin\'e4 heyair gu\'eb\'e4dibhi\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 The
 demoniac speculators cannot understand the transcendental qualities, form, pastimes, strength, knowledge and opulence of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, which are all free from material contamination (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 vin\'e4
 heyair gu\'eb\'e4dibhi\'f9}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 ). These speculators are envious of the existence of the Lord. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Jagad \'e4hur an\'e9\'e7varam:}{
\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  their conclusion is that the entire cosmic manifestation has no controller, but is just working naturally. Thus they are kept in constant darkness, birth after birth, and cannot understand the real c
ause of all causes. This is the reason why there are so many schools of philosophical speculation.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.4.32
\par }\pard\plain \s2995\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10252087 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 TEXT 32
