\par }\pard\plain \s23\qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 yo 'nugrah\'e4rtha\'e0 bhajat\'e4\'e0 p\'e4da-m\'fclam
