\insrsid10252087 bellious nature. Unless a living entity surrenders to K\'e5\'f1\'eba, he must continue this life of struggle.
\par }\pard\plain \s3005\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3824524 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 The K\'e5\'f1\'eb
