anifestation is external to the spiritual world, the spiritual world existed when there was no material world); }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 sa\'e0j\'ef\'e4na-m\'e4tram}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash only the consciousness of the living entities; }{
