\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare/ Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare, he fixes his mind at the lotus feet of the Lord. Thus he directly perceives H\'e5\'f1\'e9ke\'e7a, the master of the senses. After delivering the Harya\'e7
vas, N\'e4rada Muni continued traveling throughout the planetary systems, his mind always fixed at the lotus feet of the Lord.
