\cs3002\fs28\insrsid10252087\charrsid741136  Thus committing violence against other living entities and yet claiming to be an associate of Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, you are defaming the Supreme Personality of Godhead. You needlessly
 created a mentality of renunciation in innocent boys, and therefore you are shameless and devoid of compassion. How could you travel with the personal associates of the Supreme Lord?
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 This mentality of Praj\'e4pati Dak\'f1a still continues even today. Wh
en young boys join the K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement, their fathers and so-called guardians are very angry at the propounder of the K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement because they think that their sons have been unnecessarily induced to deprive themselves of the material enjoyments of eating, drinking and merrymaking. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Karm\'e9s,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 fruitive workers, think that one should fully enjoy his present life in this material world and also perform some pious activities to be promoted to higher planetary systems for further enjoyment in the next life. A }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
yog\'e9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  however, especially a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bhakti-yog\'e9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 is callous to the opinions of this material world. He is not interested in traveling to the higher planetary systems of the demigods to enjoy a long life in an advanced materialistic civilization. As stated by Prabodh\'e4nanda Sarasvat\'e9, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 kaivalya\'e0 narak\'e4yate trida\'e7a-p\'fcr \'e4k\'e4\'e7a-pu\'f1p\'e4yate:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 for a devotee, merging into the Brahman existence is hellish, and life in the higher planetary systems of the demigods is a will-o'-the-wisp, a phantasmagoria wi
th no real existence at all. A pure devotee is not interested in yogic perfection, travel to higher planetary systems, or oneness with Brahman. He is interested only in rendering service to the Personality of Godhead. Since Praj\'e4pati Dak\'f1a was a }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 karm\'e9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  he could not appreciate the great service N\'e4rada Muni had rendered his eleven thousand sons. Instead, he accused N\'e4rada Muni of being sinful and charged that because N\'e4
rada Muni was associated with the Supreme Personality of Godhead, the Lord would also be defamed. Thus Dak\'f1a criticized that N\'e4rada Muni was an offender to the Lord although he was known as an associate of the Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.5.39
