\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 sauh\'e5da-ghnam}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash a breaker of friendship (therefore not countable among the }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 bh\'e4gavatas,}{\insrsid10252087  or devotees of the Lord); }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 vai}{
\insrsid10252087 \emdash indeed; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 vairam-karam}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash you create enmity; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 avairi\'eb\'e4m}{\insrsid10252087 \emdash toward persons who are not enemies.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s3000\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid741136 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 
All the devotees of the Lord but you are very kind to the conditioned souls and are eager to benefit others. Although you wear the dress of a devotee, you create enmity with people who are not your enemies, or you break friendship and create enmity b
etween friends. Are you not ashamed of posing as a devotee while performing these abominable actions?
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Such are the criticisms that must be borne by the servants of N\'e4
rada Muni in the disciplic succession. Through the K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement, w
e are trying to train young people to become devotees and return home, back to Godhead, by following rigid regulative principles, but our service is appreciated neither in India nor abroad in the Western countries where we are endeavoring to spread this K
\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement. In India the caste }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  have become enemies of the K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement because we elevate foreigners, who are supposed to be }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mlecchas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 yavanas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  to the position of }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  We train them in austerities and penances and recognize them as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 by awarding them sacred threads. Thus the caste }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 of India are very displeased by our activities in the Western world. In the West also, the parents of the young people who join this movement have also become en
emies. We have no business creating enemies, but the process is such that nondevotees will always be inimical toward us. Nevertheless, as stated in the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e7\'e4stras,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 a devotee should be both tolerant and merciful. Devotees engaged in preaching should be prepare
d to be accused by ignorant persons, and yet they must be very merciful to the fallen conditioned souls. If one can execute his duty in the disciplic succession of N\'e4rada Muni, his service will surely be recognized. As the Lord says in }{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  (18.68-69):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ya ida\'e0 parama\'e0 guhya\'e0\line mad-bhakte\'f1v abhidh\'e4syati\line bhakti\'e0
 mayi par\'e4\'e0 k\'e5tv\'e4\line m\'e4m evai\'f1yaty asa\'e0\'e7aya\'f9
\par na ca tasm\'e4n manu\'f1ye\'f1u\line ka\'e7cin me priya-k\'e5ttama\'f9\line bhavit\'e4 na ca me tasm\'e4d\line anya\'f9 priyataro bhuvi
\par }\pard\plain \s3023\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9723571 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 "For one who explains the supreme secret to the devotees, 
devotional service is guaranteed, and at the end he will come back to Me. There is no servant in this world more dear to Me than he, nor will there ever be one more dear." Let us continue preaching the message of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a and not be afraid of enemies. Our only duty is to satisfy the Lord by this preaching, which will be accepted as service by Lord Caitanya and Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba. We must sincerely serve the Lord and not be deterred by so-called enemies.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 In this verse the word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sauh\'e5
da-ghnam}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  ("a breaker of friendship") is used. Because N\'e4rada Muni and the members of his disciplic succession disrupt friendships and family life, they are sometimes accused of being }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sauh\'e5da-ghnam,}{\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524  creators of enmity between relatives. Actually such devotees are friends of every living entity (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 suh\'e5da\'e0
