\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e4c\'e4rya,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  or teacher, who always travels for the benefit of human society. Praj\'e4pati Dak\'f1a cursed N\'e4rada Muni
