\cs3002\fs28\insrsid10252087\charrsid741136  My dear King, since N\'e4rada Muni is an approved saintly person, when cursed by Praj\'e4pati Dak\'f1a he replied, tad b\'e4\'f2ham: }{\cs3002\fs28\insrsid524961\charrsid741136 "}{
\cs3002\fs28\insrsid10252087\charrsid741136 Yes, what you have said is good. I accept this curse." He could have cursed Praj\'e4pati Dak\'f1a in return, but because he is a tolerant and merciful s\'e4dhu, he took no action.
