\par }{\insrsid10252087 To take protection from this shield, one must first touch }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 ku\'e7a}{\insrsid10252087  grass and wash one's mouth with }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 \'e4camana-mantras.}{\insrsid10252087 
