is spiritual energy, are not different from Him. There is no difference between the Lord and His variously presented energies. This is also confirm}{\cs3025\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 ed in the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Padma Pur
