e even worship of the Lord's weapons or ornaments has the same potency as worship of the Lord. M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9s refuse to accept the form of the Lord, or they say that the form of the Lord is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 m\'e4y\'e4,}{
