He (the Supreme Personality of Godhead); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 eva}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash indeed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 hi}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash certainly; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 puna\'f9}{
