{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 sarva-\'e9\'e7vara\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash the controller of everything; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 sakala-jagat}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash of the whole universe; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 k\'e4
ra\'eba}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash of the causes; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 k\'e4ra\'eba-bh\'fcta\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash existing as the cause; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 sarva-pratyak-\'e4tmatv\'e4t}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 
\emdash because of being the Supersoul of every living being, or being present in everything, even the atom; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 sarva-gu\'eba}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash 
of all the effects of the material modes of nature (such as intelligence and the senses); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 \'e4bh\'e4sa}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash by the manifestations; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 upalak\'f1ita\'f9}{
\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash perceived; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 eka\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash alone; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 eva}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash indeed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 paryava\'e7e\'f1ita\'f9}{
\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash left remaining.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid10252087 
With deliberation, one will see that the Supreme Soul, although manifested in different ways, is actually the basic principle of everything. The total material energy is the cause of the mate
rial manifestation, but the material energy is caused by Him. Therefore He is the cause of all causes, the manifester of intelligence and the senses. He is perceived as the Supersoul of everything. Without Him, everything would be dead. You, as that Super
soul, the supreme controller, are the only one remaining.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 The words }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sarva-vastuni vastu-svar\'fcpa\'f9}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  indicate that the Supreme Lord is the active principle of everything. As described in the }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Brahma-sa\'e0hit\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  (5.35):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 eko 'py asau racayitu\'e0 jagad-a\'eb\'f2a-ko\'f6i\'e0\line yac-chaktir asti jagad-a
