"I worship the Personality of Godhead, Govinda, who enters the existence of every universe and every atom by one of His plenary portions and thus manifests His infinite energy throughout the material creation." By His one plenary portion as Param\'e4tm
\'e4, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 antary\'e4m\'e9,}{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  the Lord is all-pervading throughout the unlimited universes. He is the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 pratyak,}{
\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 antary\'e4m\'e9,}{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  of all living entities. The Lord says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4
}{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  (13.3), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 k\'f1etra-j\'efa\'e0 c\'e4pi m\'e4\'e0 viddhi sarva-k\'f1etre\'f1u bh\'e4rata:}{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
 "O scion of Bharata, you should understand that I am also the knower in all bodies." Because the Lord is the Supersoul, He is the active principle of every living entity and even the atom (}{\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 a\'eb\'f2\'e4ntara-stha-param\'e4
\'ebu-cay\'e4ntara-stham}{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571 
). He is the actual reality. According to various stages of intelligence, one realizes the presence of the Supreme in everything through the manifestations of His energy. The entire world is permeated by the three }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 gu
\'ebas,}{\cs3027\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid9723571  and one can understand His presence according to one's modes of material nature.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.9.39
