 In this verse, however, real religious principles are explained. Everyone should be unhappy to see others in distress and happy to see others happy. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c4tmavat sarva-bh\'fcte\'f1u:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
