gardless of whether human, animal, tree or plant, all living entities are sons of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  (14.4):
