rthaka kari' kara para-upak\'e4ra
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 "One who has taken birth as a human being in the land of India [Bh\'e4rata-var\'f1
a] should make his life successful and work for the benefit of all other people.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3006\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid3824524 The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 upakury\'e4t}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  means }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 para-upak\'e4ra,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  helping others. Of course, in human society there are many institutions to hel
p others, but because philanthropists do not know how to help others, their propensity for philanthropy is ineffectual. They do not know the ultimate goal of life (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e7reya \'e4cara\'ebam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
), which is to please the Supreme Lord. If all philanthropic and humanitarian activities were directed toward achieving the ultimate goal of life\emdash to please the Supreme Personality of Godhead\emdash 
they would all be perfect. Humanitarian work without K\'e5\'f1\'eba is nothing. K\'e5\'f1\'eba must be brought to the center of all our activities; otherwise no activity will have value.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.10.11
