\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 karm\'e9's}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  possessions are achieved as a result of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 karma,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
