\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 namely, religiosity (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ), economic development (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 artha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ), sense gratification (}{
