o be attached to them no longer. Let my mind, my consciousness and everything I have be attached only to You.
\par }\pard\plain \s1178\ql \li0\ri0\sb360\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Thus end the Bhaktivedanta purports to the Sixth Canto, Eleventh Chapter, of the}{
