under the arrangement of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Victory or defeat is not actually theirs; it is an arrangement by the Lord through the agency of material nature. Pride in victory, or moroseness in defeat, is useless. One should fully depend o
n the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is responsible for the victory and defeat of all living entities. The Lord advises, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 niyata\'e0 kuru karma tva\'e0 karma jy\'e4yo hy akarma\'eba\'f9:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
