\fs28\cf1\insrsid10775694 Parabrahman}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 . Therefore everyone should hear from Me about My glorious activities." The Lord also says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  (10.2), }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 aham \'e4dir hi dev\'e4n\'e4m:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  "I am the origin of all the demigods." Therefore the Supreme Personality of Godhead is the origin of everything, and no one is independent of Him. \'c7r\'e9
la Madhv\'e4c\'e4rya also says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 an\'e9\'e7a j\'e9va-r\'fcpe\'eba:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  the living entity is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 an\'e9\'e7a,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 never the controller, but is always controlled. Therefore when a living entity becomes proud of being an independent }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e9\'e7vara,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
