ntains by engaging a government or king to see to the public's welfare, and He annihilates through agents for killing, such as}{\insrsid10252087 
 snakes. The agents for creation, maintenance and annihilation have no independent potency, but because of the spell of the illusory energy, one thinks himself the creator, maintainer and annihilator.
