). Practically everyone throughout the universe, especially on this planet, Bh\'fcrloka, thinks that there is no separate existence of the body and soul and therefore no need of self-realization. But that is not a fact. Therefore all the }{
\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\insrsid10252087  listed here, being devotees, travel all over the world to awaken K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness in the hearts of such foolish materialists.
