 According to the statements of the }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 Mah\'e4bh\'e4rata}{\insrsid10252087\charrsid4206485  (}{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 S\'e4nti-parva,}{\insrsid10252087\charrsid4206485  Chapters 218-219), an }{\cs1998\i\insrsid10252087 \'e4c
