}{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 vin\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash without; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 arthena}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash substance or reality; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 na}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash not; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 d\'e5\'e7yante}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash are seen; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 manobhav\'e4\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash creations of mental concoction; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 karmabhi\'f9}{
