\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 karm\'e4\'ebi}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash fruitive activities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 manasa\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash from the mind; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 abhavan}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 
