 According to the results of my fruitive activities, I, the living being, transmigrate from one body to an
other, sometimes going to the species of the demigods, sometimes to the species of lower animals, sometimes among the vegetables, and sometimes to the human species. Therefore, in which birth were these my mother and father? No one is actually my mother a
