\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  the supreme controller, He is not affected by dual
ity. It may therefore be said that He sits in the core of everyone's heart as the neutral witness of the causes and effects of one's activities, good and bad. We should also understand that }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ud\'e4s\'e9na,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  neutral, does not mean that He takes no action. Rather, i
t means that He is not personally affected. For example, a court judge is neutral when two opposing parties appear before him, but he still takes action as the case warrants. To become completely neutral, indifferent, to material activities, we should sim
ply seek shelter at the lotus feet of the supreme neutral person.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Mah\'e4r\'e4
