\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  infallible; they do not fall down like the conditioned souls. The ordinary living entity is prone to falling into the clutches of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 m\'e4y\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
