\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 m\'e4tr\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  in its different imports, is used to indicate the decoration of the ear, possession, respect, and the possession of a covering. As stated in 
}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  (2.14):
