\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 parama-parame\'f1\'f6hin.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  He is the Supreme Person, yet He is very kind to the devotees. No one is competent to serve the Lord, but even if a devotee is n
ot competent, the merciful Lord accepts the humble attempt of the devotee.
