u, who lies in the Causal Ocean. While He sleeps in that ocean, millions of universes are generated as He exhales, and they are all annihilated when He inhales. This Mah\'e4-vi\'f1\'ebu is a plenary portion of a portion of Vi\'f1\'ebu, Govinda (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 yasya kal\'e4-vi\'e7e\'f1a\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ). The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 kal\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  refers to a plenary portion of a plenary portion. From K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, or Govinda, comes Balar\'e4ma; from Balar\'e4ma comes Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba; from Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba, N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba; from N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, the second Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba; from the second Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba, Mah\'e4-vi\'f1\'ebu; from Mah\'e4-vi
\'f1\'ebu, Garbhodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi\'f1\'ebu; and from Garbhodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi\'f1\'ebu, K\'f1\'e9rodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi\'f1\'ebu. K\'f1\'e9rodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi\'f1\'ebu controls every universe. This gives an idea of the meaning of }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ananta,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  unlimited. What is to be said of the unlimited potency and existence of the Lord? This verse describes the coverings of the universe (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 saptabhir da
\'e7a-gu\'ebottarair a\'eb\'f2a-ko\'e7a\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ). The first covering is earth, the second is water, the third is fire, the fourth is air, the fifth is sky, the sixth is the total material energy, and the seventh is
 the false ego. Beginning with the covering of earth, each covering is ten times greater than the previous one. Thus we can only imagine how great each universe is, and there are many millions of universes. As confirmed by the Lord Himself in }{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  (10.42):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 athav\'e4 bahunaitena\line ki\'e0 j\'ef\'e4tena tav\'e4rjuna\line vi\'f1\'f6abhy\'e4
