\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \line h\'e5\'f1\'e9ke\'eba h\'e5\'f1\'e9ke\'e7a-\line sevana\'e0 bhaktir ucyate}{\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
"One should be free from all material designations and cleansed of all material contamination.
 He should be restored to his pure identity, in which he engages his senses in the service of the proprietor of the senses. That is called devotional service." This is also called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bh\'e4gavata-dharma.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  Without material aspirations, one should simply serve K\'e5\'f1\'eba, as advised in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 N\'e4rada Pa\'efcar
\'e4tra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Bh\'e4gavata-dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 is the process of religion enunciated by pure devotees, direct representatives of the Supreme Personality of Godhead like N\'e4rada, \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 and their humble servants in the disciplic succession. By understanding }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bh\'e4gavata-dharma,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 one immediately becomes free from material contamination. Living entities, who are part and parcel of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, are loitering in this material world suffering. When they are instructed by the Lord Himself about }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bh\'e4gavata-dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  and they adopt it, that is victory for the Lord, for He then reclaims these fallen souls. A devotee following the principles of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bh\'e4
gavata-dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  feels very much obligated to the Supreme Personality of Godhead. He can understand the difference between life without }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bh\'e4gavata-dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 and life with }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 bh\'e4gavata-dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  and thus he ever remains obliged to the Lord. Taking to K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness and bringing fallen souls to K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness is vic
tory for Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 sa vai pu\'e0s\'e4\'e0 paro dharmo\line yato bhaktir adhok\'f1aje\line 
ahaituky apratihat\'e4\line yay\'e4tm\'e4 supras\'e9dati
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 "The supreme occupation }{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid4597575 [}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 dharma}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid4597575 ]}{\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087\charrsid4597575  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
for all humanity is that by which men can attain to loving devotional service unto the transcendent Lord. Such devotional service must be unmotivated and uninterrupted in order to completely satisfy the self." (}{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1651685\charrsid1651685 Bh\'e4g.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  1.2.6) Therefore }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  is the pure transcendental process of religion.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.16.41
