anyatra}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash elsewhere (in religious systems other than }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 bh\'e4gavata-dharma);}{\fs28\insrsid10252087  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 vi\'f1ama-dhiy\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash 
by this unequal intelligence; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 racita\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash made; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 ya\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash that which; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 sa\'f9}{
