nonmoving; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 cara}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash moving; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 sattva-kadambe\'f1u}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash among the living entities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 ap\'e5thak-dhiya\'f9}{
