\emdash the Supersoul of all living entities (the supreme director and enjoyer of them); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 bh\'fcta-bh\'e4vana\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash the cause for the manifestation of all living entities; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 \'e7abda-brahma}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 \emdash the transcendental sound vibration (the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 mantra}{\fs28\insrsid10252087 ); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid10252087 param brahma}{
