When a person is in deep sleep, he dreams and sees in himself many other objects, such as great mountains and rivers or perhaps even the entire universe, although they are far away. Sometimes when one awakens f
rom a dream he sees that he is in a human form, lying in his bed in one place. Then he sees himself, in terms of various conditions, as belonging to a particular nationality, family and so on. All the conditions of deep sleep, dreaming and wakefulness are
 but energies of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. One should always remember the original creator of these conditions, the Supreme Lord, who is unaffected by them.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid10252087 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 None of these conditions of the living entities\emdash namely, deep sleep, dreaming and w
akefulness\emdash 
is substantial. They are simply displays of various phases of conditional life. There may be many mountains, rivers, trees, bees, tigers and snakes that are situated far away, but in a dream one may imagine them to be nearby. Similarly, as one h
as subtle dreams at night, when the living entity is awake he lives in gross dreams of nation, community, society, possessions, skyscrapers, bank balance, position and honor. Under the circumstances, one should know that his position is due to his contact
 
with the material world. One is situated in different positions in various forms of life that are all but creations of the illusory energy, which works under the direction of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Therefore the Supreme Lord is the ultimate a
ctor, and the conditioned living entity should simply remember this original actor, \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eba. As living entities, we are being carried away by the waves of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 prak\'e5ti,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 or nature, which works under the Lord's direction (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 may\'e4dhyak\'f1e\'eba prak\'e5ti\'f9 s\'fcyate sa-car\'e4caram}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ). Bhaktivinoda \'d6h\'e4kura sings, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
(miche) m\'e4y\'e4ra va\'e7e, y\'e4ccha bhese', kh\'e4ccha h\'e4bu\'f2ubu, bh\'e4i:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  "Why are you being carried away by the waves of the illusory energy in various phases of dreaming and wakefulness? These are all creations of }
{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 " Our only duty is to remember the supreme director of this illusory energy\emdash K\'e5\'f1\'eba. For us to do this, the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \'e7\'e4stra}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  advises us, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 harer n\'e4ma harer n\'e4ma harer n\'e4maiva kevalam:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  one should constantly chant the holy name of the Lord\emdash Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1
\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare/ Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare. The Supreme Lord is realized in three different phases, as Brahman, Param\'e4tm\'e4 and Bhagav\'e4n, but Bhagav\'e4
n is the ultimate realization. One who realizes Bhagav\'e4n\emdash the Supreme Personality of Godhead, K\'e5\'f1\'eba\emdash is the most perfect }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mah\'e4tm\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 v\'e4sudeva\'f9 sarvam iti sa mah\'e4tm\'e4 sudurlabha\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 ). In the human form of life, one should understand the Supreme Personality of Godhead, for then one will understand everything else. 
}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Yasmin vij\'ef\'e4te sarvam eva\'e0 vij\'ef\'e4ta\'e0 bhavati.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  According to this Vedic injunction, simply by understanding K\'e5\'f1\'eba one understands Brahman, Param\'e4tm\'e4, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 prak\'e5ti,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  the illusory energy, the spiritual energy and everything else. Everything will be revealed. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Prak\'e5ti,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid7352822 
 the material nature, is}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  working under the direction of the Supreme Lord, and we living entities are being carried away by various phases of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 prak\'e5ti.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
 For self-realization, one should always remember K\'e5\'f1\'eba. As stated in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Padma Pur\'e4\'eba, smartavya\'f9 satata\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebu\'f9:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  we should always remember Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Vismartavyo na j\'e4tucit:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  we should never forget the Lord. This is the perfection of life.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid10252087 SB 6.16.55
