iva cease this external behavior so that others might be saved from criticizing him and thus becoming offenders. If one thinks that Vi\'f1\'eb
u, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, is the only perfect personality whereas the demigods, even such demigods as Lord \'c7iva, are inclined to improper social affairs, he is an 
offender. Considering all this, King Citraketu was somewhat harsh in his behavior with Lord \'c7iva.
