\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 \emdash superior authority, or the agents of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. He knew that he had not committed any offense at the lotus feet of Lord \'c7iva or the goddess P\'e4rvat\'e9
, yet he had been punished, and this means that the punishment had been ordained. Thus the King did not mind it. A devotee is naturally so humble and meek that he accepts any condition of life as a blessing from the Lord. }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Tat te 'nukamp\'e4\'e0 susam\'e9k\'f1am\'e4\'eba\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1651685\charrsid1651685 Bh\'e4g.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
