n brahma-bh\'fcy\'e4ya kalpate:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  one who is engaged in devotional service has already been freed from the reactions of his material }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 karma,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
