\par }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 The Lord is very kind and affectionate toward His devotees, and therefore a devotee, in any condition, is not subjected to the results of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 karma.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  A devote
