 ignorant, in different degrees. This ignorance continues very strongly in the mode of ignorance presented by material nature. One must therefore promote him
self to the stage of goodness through his character and behavior and then gradually come to the transcendental platform, or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 adhok\'f1aja}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 
