\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 j\'ef\'e4n\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  take shelter of V\'e4sudeva, their speculative knowledge is imperfect. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Ye 'nye 'ravind\'e4k\'f1a vimukta-m\'e4nina\'f9.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  They simply think of becoming free from the contamination of the material world, but because they do not take shelter at the lotus feet of V\'e4
sudeva, their knowledge is impure. When they actually become pure, they surrender to the lotus feet of V\'e4sudeva. Therefore, the Absolute Truth is easier to understand for a devotee than for }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 j\'ef\'e4n\'e9s}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  who simply speculate to understand V\'e4sudeva. Lord \'c7iva confirms this statement in the following verse.
