{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 puru\'f1a.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  Whether one is a man or a woman, he is not interested in serving others; everyone is interested in satisfying his or her own senses. K\'e5\'f1\'eb
