ava, a devotee of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. If she agrees to follow the rules and regulations of the Vai\'f1\'ebava principles, the unclean core of her heart will certainly be cleansed." }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 Ceto-darpa\'eba-m\'e4rjanam.}{
