\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087 mantra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10252087  and thus become fully pure, free from all material contamination. Once one becomes a pure Vai\'f1\'ebava, he transcends all material conceptions of life. Thus Ka\'e7
