\'f1m\'e9, the goddess of fortune, is the constant companion of Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu; they remain together constantly. One cannot keep Lak\'f1m\'e9 in one's home without Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. To think that one can do so is very dangerous. To keep Lak\'f1m\'e9
, or the riches of the Lord, without the service of the Lord is always dangerous, for then Lak\'f1m\'e9 becomes the illusory energy. With Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, however, Lak\'f1m\'e9 is the spiritual energy.
